hadiths[65]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3021","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezon par main qasam khata hun: Allah taala us ko jis ka Islam mein hissa hai us jaise nahi karega jis ka koi hissa nahi; aur Islam ke hisse teen hain: namaz, roza aur zakat. Aur Allah duniya mein jis bande ka sarparast banta hai, qayamat ke din use kisi aur ke supurd nahi karega. Aur jo aadmi kisi qaum se mohabbat kare, Allah use unhi ke saath kar dega. Aur chauthi cheez, agar main us par qasam khaun to ummeed hai ke gunahgar na hun: Allah duniya mein jis bande ko chhupata hai, qayamat ke din bhi use chhupayega."
"3022","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezon se main apni ummat par darta hun: sitaron se baarish mangna, hukmaran ka zulm aur taqdeer ka inkar."
"3023","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein jab nikal aayengi to kisi jaan ko us ka iman faida nahi dega jo pehle iman na layi ho ya apne iman mein neki na kamayi ho: suraj ka maghrib se tuloo hona, Dajjal aur zameen ka janwar."
"3024","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezon par main qasam khata hun: sadqe se bande ke maal mein kami nahi hoti; aur jis bande par zulm kiya jaye aur wo us par sabr kare to Allah azzawajal use izzat mein barha deta hai; aur jo banda mangne ka darwaza khole to Allah us par faqr ka darwaza khol deta hai. Aur main tumhein aik hadees sunata hun, use yaad rakho: duniya to chaar aadmiyon ke liye hai: aik banda jise Allah ne maal aur ilm diya; pas wo us mein apne Rab se darta hai, us mein sila-rehmi karta hai aur us mein Allah ka haq ada karta hai; pas ye buland-tareen darje mein hai. Aur aik banda jise Allah taala ne ilm diya aur maal nahi diya; wo sachchi niyyat wala hai aur kehta hai: Kaash mere paas maal hota to main falan ke amal jaisa amal karta; pas wo apni niyyat par hai, donon ka ajr barabar hai. Aur aik banda jise Allah ne maal diya aur ilm nahi diya; wo apne maal mein bila-ilm idhar-udhar maarta hai: na us mein apne Rab se darta hai, na us mein sila-rehmi karta hai, na us mein Allah ka haq ada karta hai; pas ye bad-tareen darje mein hai. Aur aik banda jise Allah ne na maal diya na ilm; wo kehta hai: Kaash mere paas maal hota to main us mein falan ke amal jaisa amal karta; pas wo apni niyyat par hai, donon ka gunah barabar hai."
"3025","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezon par main qasam khata hun: sadqe se maal mein kabhi kami nahi hoti, pas sadqa karo; aur jo aadmi us zulm se darguzar kare jo us par kiya gaya ho to Allah taala us ki wajah se use izzat mein barha deta hai, pas maaf karo, Allah tumhein izzat mein barhayega; aur jo aadmi apne upar mangne ka darwaza khole ke logon se mange to Allah us par faqr ka darwaza khol deta hai."
"3026","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein hain, agar kisi cheez mein shifa hai to: singi lagane wale ka cheera, shehad ka sharbat, ya dagh jo dard ko lag jaye; aur main daghne ko napasand karta hun aur use pasand nahi karta."
"3027","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein hain jin ka sanjeeda bhi sanjeeda hai aur mazaq bhi sanjeeda hai: nikah, talaq aur rujoo."
"3028","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein har musalman par haq hain: Juma ke din ghusl, miswak aur khushbu."
"3029","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen khaslatein duniya mein musalman aadmi ki saadat mein se hain: naik parosi, khula ghar aur aaraam-deh sawari."
"3030","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen duayein qubool hoti hain: rozedar ki dua, mazloom ki dua aur musafir ki dua."
"3031","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen duayein qubool hoti hain jin mein koi shak nahi: waldain ki apni aulad ke haq mein dua, musafir ki dua aur mazloom ki dua."
"3032","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen duayein radd nahi hotin: walid ki apni aulad ke liye dua, rozedar ki dua aur musafir ki dua."
"3033","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen duayein hain jo qubool hoti hain, un mein koi shak nahi: mazloom ki dua, musafir ki dua aur walid ki apni aulad ke liye dua."
"3034","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezon mein maut ke siwa har bimari se shifa hai: sana aur saunf."
"3035","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein sab har musalman par haq hain: mareez ki iyadat, janaze mein haziri aur chheenkne wale ko yarhamukallah kehna jab wo Alhamdulillah kahe."
"3036","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Makka se wapsi ke baad muhajir ke liye teen din hain."
"3037","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein meri ummat mein baqi rahi hain: nasabon par fakhr, nauha aur sitaron se baarish talab karna."
"3038","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein nabuwat ke akhlaq mein se hain: iftar mein jaldi, sehri mein der aur namaz mein dayen haath ko bayen par rakhna."
"3039","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen nijaat dene waliyan hain: chhupe aur khule mein Allah taala ka khauf, raza aur ghusse mein insaaf, aur faqr aur ghina mein miyana-ravi. Aur teen halaak karne waliyan hain: pairwi ki jane wali khwahish, itaat ki jane wali kanjoosi, aur aadmi ka apne aap par khush hona."
"3040","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein ehl-e-jahiliyyat ke amal mein se hain jinhein ehl-e-Islam nahi chhorte: sitaron se baarish talab karna, nasab mein taan karna aur mayyat par nauha karna."
"3041","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo teen kaam kare us ne iman ka zaika chakh liya: jo akela Allah ki ibadat kare aur gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi; aur apne maal ki zakat khush-dili se har saal madad karte hue de; na boodhi de, na dagh-daar, na beemar, na ghatiya shart wali, balke apne darmiyane maalon mein se de; kyunke Allah ne tum se tumhara behtareen nahi manga aur tumhein tumhara bura dene ka hukm nahi diya; aur apne nafs ko paak kare."
"3042","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har maheene mein teen roze aur Ramazan se Ramazan tak; ye poore zamane ke roze hain."
"3043","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen khaslatein jis mein hon wo munafiq hai chahe roza rakhe, namaz parhe, hajj aur umra kare aur kahe ke main musalman hun: jab baat kare to jhoot bole, jab wada kare to khilaf kare, aur jab amanat rakhi jaye to khayanat kare."
"3044","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen khaslatein jis mein hon us ne iman ki mithaas pa li: ke Allah aur us ka Rasool use un ke siwa sab se zyada mehboob hon; aur wo aadmi se mohabbat kare to sirf Allah ke liye kare; aur wo kufr mein laut-ne ko aise napasand kare jaise aag mein daale jane ko napasand karta hai, is ke baad ke Allah ne use us se nijaat di."
"3045","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen halaak karne waliyan, teen nijaat dene waliyan, teen kaffare aur teen darje hain. Rahi halaak karne waliyan: to itaat ki jane wali kanjoosi, pairwi ki jane wali khwahish, aur aadmi ka apne aap par khush hona. Aur rahi nijaat dene waliyan: to ghusse aur raza mein insaaf, faqr aur ghina mein miyana-ravi, aur chhupe aur khule mein Allah taala ka khauf. Aur rahe kaffare: to namaz ke baad namaz ka intezar, sardi mein wuzu poora karna, aur qadam jama'aton ki taraf le jana. Aur rahe darje: to khana khilana, salam phailana, aur raat ko namaz parhna jab log soye hon."
"3046","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein radd nahi ki jatin: takiye, tel aur doodh."
"3047","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezon mein khel jaiz nahi: talaq, nikah aur azaadi."
"3048","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein roki nahi jatin: paani, ghaas aur aag."
"3049","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ki dua qubool hoti hai: walid, musafir aur mazloom."
"3050","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ki madad Allah taala par haq hai: Allah ke raaste mein jihad karne wala, mukatib jo adayegi chahta ho, aur nikah karne wala jo paak-damani chahta ho."
"3051","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmi Allah azzawajal ki zamanat mein hain: aik aadmi jo Allah azzawajal ki masjidon mein se kisi masjid ki taraf nikle; aur aik aadmi jo Allah taala ke raaste mein ghazi ban kar nikle; aur aik aadmi jo hajj ke liye nikle."
"3052","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon par Allah ne jannat haraam kar di hai: sharaab ka aadi, waldain ka nafarman, aur dayyus jo apne ghar walon mein behayai ko barqarar rakhe."
"3053","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmi, sab Allah ki zamanat mein hain: aik aadmi jo Allah ke raaste mein ghazi ban kar nikle, pas wo Allah ki zamanat mein hai yahan tak ke wo use faut karke jannat mein dakhil kare ya use wapas laye us ajr ya maal-e-ghaneemat ke saath jo use mila; aur aik aadmi jo masjid ki taraf gaya, pas wo Allah ki zamanat mein hai yahan tak ke wo use faut karke jannat mein dakhil kare ya use wapas laye us ajr ke saath jo use mila; aur aik aadmi jo apne ghar mein salamti ke saath dakhil hua, pas wo Allah ki zamanat mein hai."
"3054","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein jahiliyyat ke aamaal mein se hain jinhein log nahi chhorte: nasabon mein taan karna, mayyat par nauha karna, aur un ka kehna ke ham par falan falan sitare se baarish hui."
"3055","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein jahiliyyat mein se hain: nasabon par fakhr, nasabon mein taan aur nauha."
"3056","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen saadat mein se hain aur teen bad-bakhti mein se. Pas saadat mein se: naik aurat jise tum dekho to tumhein khush kare, aur jab tum us se door ho to tum apni zaat aur apne maal par us se be-khauf raho; aur sawari jo narm ho to tumhein tumhare sathiyon se mila de; aur ghar jo khula aur sahoolaton wala ho. Aur bad-bakhti mein se: aurat jise tum dekho to tumhein buri lage, aur tum par apni zaban chalaye, aur jab tum us se door ho to tum apni zaat aur apne maal par us se be-khauf na raho; aur sawari jo sar-kash ho: agar tum use maaro to tumhein thaka de aur agar use chhor do to tumhein tumhare sathiyon se na milaye; aur ghar jo tang aur kam sahoolaton wala ho."
"3057","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ki namaz un ke kaanon se aage nahi barhti: bhaaga hua ghulam yahan tak ke wapas aaye; aur aurat jis ne raat guzari jabke us ka shohar us par naraaz ho; aur qaum ka imam jabke wo use napasand karte hon."
"3058","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ke baare mein na pucho: aik aadmi jo jama'at se juda hua, apne imam ki nafarmani ki aur nafarman mar gaya; aur laundi ya ghulam jo apne aaqa se bhaag gaya aur mar gaya; aur aurat jis ka shohar us se door gaya ho jabke us ne us ke liye duniya ka kharch kaafi kar diya ho, phir us ke baad ban-sanwar kar nikle; pas in ke baare mein na pucho."
"3059","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ke baare mein na pucho: aik aadmi jo Allah ke tehband mein jhagra kare; aur aik aadmi jo Allah ki chadar mein jhagra kare, kyunke us ki chadar kibriyaai hai aur us ka tehband izzat hai; aur aik aadmi jo Allah ke muamle mein shak mein ho aur Allah ki rehmat se na-ummeed ho."
"3060","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ke qareeb farishte nahi aate: nashe mein madhosh, zaafran mein basa hua, haaiza aur junubi."
"3061","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ke qareeb farishte nahi aate: kafir ki laash, khalooq mein basa hua, aur junubi magar ye ke wuzu kar le."
"3062","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmi kabhi jannat mein dakhil nahi honge: dayyus, aurton mein se mardnuma aur sharaab ka aadi."
"3063","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmi jannat mein dakhil nahi honge: waldain ka nafarman, dayyus aur aurton mein se mardnuma."
"3064","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ki dua Allah radd nahi karta: Allah ko kasrat se yaad karne wala, mazloom aur insaaf karne wala imam."
"3065","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon se Allah qayamat ke din na badla qubool karega na fidya: nafarman, ehsan jataane wala aur taqdeer ka inkar karne wala."
"3066","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon se Allah qayamat ke din kalaam nahi karega aur na unhein dekhega: aik aadmi jo apne saamaan par qasam khaye ke use is se zyada diya gaya jitna use diya gaya jabke wo jhoota ho; aur aik aadmi jo Asr ke baad jhooti qasam khaye taake us se kisi musalman ka maal kaat le; aur aik aadmi jo apne paani ki zyadti ko roke; to Allah farmayega: Aaj main tum se apna fazl rokta hun jaise tum ne us cheez ka fazl roka jo tumhare haathon ne nahi banayi."
"3067","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon se Allah qayamat ke din kalaam nahi karega, na unhein dekhega, na unhein paak karega, aur un ke liye dardnaak azab hai: tehband latkaane wala; ehsan jataane wala jo koi cheez na de magar ehsan jata kar; aur apna saamaan jhooti qasam se bechne wala."
"3068","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon se Allah qayamat ke din kalaam nahi karega, na unhein dekhega, na unhein paak karega, aur un ke liye dardnaak azab hai: jungle mein zaid paani wala aadmi jo use musafir se roke; aur aadmi jo Asr ke baad kisi aadmi se sauda kare aur use Allah ki qasam kha kar kahe ke us ne ise itne itne mein liya hai to wo use sachcha samjhe jabke wo us ke khilaf ho; aur aadmi jo imam se baiat kare aur us se siwa duniya ke liye baiat na kare: agar wo use us mein se de to wafa kare aur agar na de to wafa na kare."
"3069","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon se Allah qayamat ke din kalaam nahi karega, na unhein paak karega, na unhein dekhega, aur un ke liye dardnaak azab hai: boodha zanakaar, jhoota baadshah aur mutakabbir mohtaaj."
"3070","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ko Allah kal nahi dekhega: boodha zanakaar; aur aadmi jo qasmon ko tijarat banaye ke har haq aur baatil mein qasam khaye; aur mutakabbir faqeer jo itraata ho."
"3071","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ko Allah qayamat ke din nahi dekhega: waldain ka nafarman, mardnuma aurat jo mardon se mushabihat kare, aur dayyus. Aur teen aadmi jannat mein dakhil nahi honge: waldain ka nafarman, sharaab ka aadi aur de kar ehsan jataane wala."
"3072","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon ko Allah qayamat ke din nahi dekhega, na unhein paak karega, aur un ke liye dardnaak azab hai: safed-baal zanakaar, mutakabbir mohtaaj, aur aadmi jo Allah ko apni poonji banaye: na khareede magar apni qasam se, na beche magar apni qasam se."
"3073","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmi apna ajr dohra payenge: ehl-e-kitaab mein se aik aadmi jo apne Nabi par iman laya aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko pa kar un par iman laya, un ki pairwi ki aur un ki tasdeeq ki, pas us ke liye dohra ajr hai; aur ghulam jo Allah ka haq aur apne aaqa ka haq ada kare, pas us ke liye dohra ajr hai; aur aadmi jis ki laundi ho aur wo use khilaye aur achchi tarah khilaye, phir use adab sikhaye aur achchi tarah adab sikhaye, use taleem de aur achchi tarah taleem de, phir use azaad kare aur us se nikah kare, pas us ke liye dohra ajr hai."
"3074","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmiyon se Allah mohabbat karta hai aur teen se Allah nafrat karta hai: aadmi jo dushman ko jamaa't mein mile aur un ke liye apni gardan bichha de yahan tak ke qatl ho jaye ya apne sathiyon ke liye fatah hasil kare; aur qaum safar kare aur un ka safar lamba ho yahan tak ke wo zameen ko chhuna chahein, pas wo utrein aur un mein se aik alag ho kar namaz parhe yahan tak ke unhein kooch ke liye jagaye; aur aadmi jis ka parosi ho aur us ka parosi use takleef de to wo us ki takleef par sabr kare yahan tak ke maut ya kooch un ke darmiyan juda kar de. Aur jin se Allah nafrat karta hai: qasam khane wala tajir, mutakabbir faqeer, aur bakheel ehsan jataane wala."
"3075","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmi Allah azzawajal se dua karte hain to un ki dua qubool nahi hoti: aadmi jis ke neeche bad-akhlaq biwi ho aur wo use talaq na de; aur aadmi jis ka kisi aadmi par maal ho aur wo us par gawah na banaye; aur aadmi jo bewaquf ko apna maal de jabke Allah taala ne farmaya: Be-waqufon ko apne maal na do."
"3076","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharaab ki qeemat haraam hai, zanakaar aurat ka meher haraam hai, kutte ki qeemat haraam hai, aur tabla haraam hai; aur agar kutte wala tumhare paas us ki qeemat mangne aaye to us ke donon haath mitti se bhar do; aur sharaab aur jua haraam hai, aur har nashawar cheez haraam hai."
"3077","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kutte ki qeemat gandi hai, zanakaar aurat ka meher ganda hai, aur hajaam ki kamayi gandi hai."
"3078","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do cheezein radd nahi hotin: azan ke waqt dua aur baarish ke neeche dua."
"3079","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do cheezein radd nahi hotin: azan ke waqt dua aur sakhti ke waqt dua jab baaz baaz se jur jayein."
"3080","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teesra hissa, aur teesra hissa bahut hai."
"3081","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teesra hissa, aur teesra hissa bahut hai; beshak tumhara apne maal se sadqa karna sadqa hai; aur tumhara apne ghar walon par kharch karna sadqa hai; aur jo tumhari biwi tumhare maal mein se khati hai wo sadqa hai; aur tum apne ghar walon ko khush-haal chhoro ye is se behtar hai ke tum unhein logon se mangta chhoro."
"3082","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teesra hissa, aur teesra hissa bahut hai; beshak tum apne warison ko ghani chhoro ye is se behtar hai ke tum unhein mohtaaj chhoro ke logon se mangein; aur tum jo kharch Allah ki raza chahte hue karo us par tumhein ajr diya jayega, yahan tak ke jo tum apni biwi ke munh mein rakhte ho."
"3083","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bewa apne nafs par apne wali se zyada haq rakhti hai; aur kunwari se us ka baap us ke nafs ke baare mein ijazat lega, aur us ki ijazat us ki khamoshi hai."
"3084","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bewa apne nafs ka izhaar karti hai aur kunwari ki raza us ki khamoshi hai."
"3085","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaadi-shuda zanakaron ko kore lagaye jayenge aur sangsar kiya jayega; aur ghair-shaadi-shuda zanakaron ko kore lagaye jayenge aur sheher-badar kiya jayega."
